    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22289" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλεύκ-ινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλεῦκος</span>
			<i>as a vehicle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρον</span>, a
			special kind of confection or oil, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Androm.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.1039
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.55
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἔλαιον</span>
				Colum.<i><span class="en">
				12.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				23.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>partly fermented</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
